<title>USA: Hugoton Energy adds wells in Kansas.</title>
<headline>Hugoton Energy adds wells in Kansas.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hugoton Energy Corp said Monday it added six more square miles and three wells at a 34-square-mile site in southwestern Kansas.</p>
<p>The company said it currently has three rigs drilling on the site. Seven wells are expected to be added by the end of the year, with 10 additional wells planned for early 1997, said Hugoton.</p>
<p>Hugoton owns a 50-percent working interest in the region.</p>
<p>Hugoton is an independent oil and natural gas company.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
